I(49,[57,59,61],'other',[53,55,57],'1926–1947;1975–1999;2027–2041','transverses','Reused manifold text: weakening differentiability, orbit maps/stabilizers and homogeneous spaces, relative groups, transverse fiber products and their universal property.','The orbit identification needs the stated locally closed/countability hypotheses; tangent arguments require differentiability. Completeness/metrizability depends on the ambient manifold conventions not fully supplied.','agrees','The note does not promote missing surrounding definitions into a new theorem.')
